nicity and can include people of any race. The six race categories include Hispanic residents; White alone, not Hispanic or Latino is a subset of White alone. Do not add all eight rows together. “Alone” means one reported race."},{"code":"RHI425225","label":"Asian alone","position":3,"headline_position":null,"unit":"percent","topic_id":"race-ethnicity","definition":"Hispanic or Latino is an ethnicity and can include people of any race. The six race categories include Hispanic residents; White alone, not Hispanic or Latino is a subset of White alone. Do not add all eight rows together. “Alone” means one reported race."},{"code":"RHI525225","label":"Native Hawaiian and Other Pacific Islander alone","position":4,"headline_position":null,"unit":"percent","topic_id":"race-ethnicity","definition":"Hispanic or Latino is an ethnicity and can include people of any race. The six race categories include Hispanic residents; White alone, not Hispanic or Latino is a subset of White alone. Do not add all eight rows together. “Alone” means one reported race."},{"code":"RHI625225","label":"Two or more races","position":5,"headline_position":null,"unit":"percent","topic_id":"race-ethnicity","definition":"Hispanic or Latino is an ethnicity and can include people of any race. The six race categories include Hispanic residents; White alone, not Hispanic or Latino is a subset of White alone. Do not add all eight rows together. “Alone” means one reported race."},{"code":"RHI725225","label":"Hispanic or Latino, any race","position":6,"headline_position":null,"unit":"percent","topic_id":"race-ethnicity","definition":"Hispanic or Latino is an ethnicity and can include people of any race. The six race categories include Hispanic residents; White alone, not Hispanic or Latino is a subset of White alone. Do not add all eight rows together. “Alone” means one reported race."},{"code":"RHI825225","label":"White alone, not Hispanic or Latino","position":7,"headline_position":null,"unit":"percent","